  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together coconut milk, plain yogurt, garam masala, cumin powder, coriander powder, turmeric powder, red chili powder, and salt.",
    "Add the crumbled tofu to the bowl and mix well to coat.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and cover with aluminum foil.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes, then remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 10-15 minutes, or until lightly browned.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot.",
    "Serve over basmati rice or with naan bread for a complete meal."
